ues.If you play the demo, I'd love to hear what you think. Tell me what you enjoyed, what you'd like to see improved, and what you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T05:22:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183775803","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4771500-1833968530892058","game_id":"steam-4771500","kind":"announcement","title":"Welcome to Last Zone: Quarantine!","summary":"Hello everyone! We are thrilled to finally launch our Steam store page.Last Zone: Quarantine is a project we are pouring our hearts into, focusing on building an immersive post-Soviet survival atmosphere and mechanics that will really test your skills.We are currently working hard on refining the project, adding new content, and making improvements. Your feedback is incredibly important to us at this early stage, so if you have any questions or suggestions, please feel free to share them here in","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-29T18:53:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530892058","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4771500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:04:06Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:04:06Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4771500":"2026-10-26T04:04:06Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4771500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:04:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:04:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5017160":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:04:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:04:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4771500","app_id":4771500,"app_sc